Verify your new email - {{#if header_title}}{{header_title}}{{else}}TimeOff.Management{{/if}}
=====
{{# with user ~}}
<h2>Hello {{this.name}},</h2>

<div class="info-box">
  <p><strong>Email change request</strong></p>
  <p>Someone requested to change the sign-in email for your account at {{#if header_title}}{{> email/link
    href=(get_application_domain) text=header_title }}{{else}}{{> email/link href=(get_application_domain)
    text='TimeOff.Management' }}{{/if}}.</p>
  <p><strong>New email:</strong> {{../pending_email}}</p>
  <p><strong>Current email on your account:</strong> {{this.email}}</p>
</div>

<div class="info-box info-box-success">
  <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #059669;">Your verification code</h3>
  <p style="font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.15em; font-family: monospace; margin: 16px 0;">
    {{../verification_code}}</p>
  <p>Enter this code on your <strong>My profile</strong> page to confirm the change. The code expires in 24 hours.</p>
</div>

<div class="info-box">
  <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #1f2937;">Did not request this?</h3>
  <p>If you did not request this change, you can ignore this message. Your account email will stay as
    <strong>{{this.email}}</strong> unless you enter the code while signed in.</p>
</div>

{{~/ with}}

<p style="margin-top: 20px;">Best regards,<br>
  <strong>The {{#if header_title}}{{header_title}}{{else}}TimeOff.Management{{/if}} Team</strong>
</p>
